     1380   DEFINE FRAME F-Main
     1381        SortType at row 2.5 col 51.88 NO-LABEL
     1382        Tog-obj at row 2.54 col 2.13
     1383        Classify at row 3.79 col 2.13 NO-LABEL
     1384        Tog-lavel at row 6 col 21.38
